[h2]Build 0.9.114[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]RimWorld 1.7 support.[/b] The mod is now listed as compatible with 1.7, so the mod list no longer flags it as an incompatible version. Checked against 1.7: everything the mod uses from the game is still there, and all of its Harmony patches apply under 1.7's new Harmony.
[*]No gameplay changes. Safe to update mid-save.
[/list]
